# Minimal reset-vector replay example.
# Expected bytes are auto-derived from the ROM hex passed to the harness.

0xFFFC R 0x00 0 ? OUT
0xFFFD R 0x00 0 ? OUT
0xC000 R 0x00 0 ? OUT
0xC001 R 0x00 0 ? OUT
0xC002 R 0x00 0 ? OUT
0xC003 R 0x00 0 ? OUT

# Example write visibility checks
0x4001 W 0x3F 0 ? IN
0x8000 W 0x03 0 ? IN

# Example MARIA DMA read visibility
0x8000 R 0x00 1 ? OUT